## 🟡 Medium — Missing Negative/Edge-Case Tests

These tests don't exist at all, meaning entire error paths are uncovered:

| Missing test | Production risk |
|---|---|
| `UpdatePrice` with unknown SKU | Should throw `KeyNotFoundException`; never tested |
| `GetProduct` with unknown SKU | Should return `null`; never tested |
| `RemoveProduct` with unknown SKU | Silent no-op vs exception undefined |
| `ImportFromCsv` with malformed data | `IndexOutOfRangeException` / `FormatException` unhandled |
| `ApplyBulkDiscount` with fraction ≥ 1 | Prices go to zero or negative — no guard |
| `ExportToCsv` with commas in name | CSV injection / malformed output |

Example fix for the most dangerous one:
```csharp
[TestMethod]
[ExpectedException(typeof(KeyNotFoundException))]
public void UpdatePrice_UnknownSku_Throws()
{
    _catalog.UpdatePrice("MISSING", 5.00m);
}
```

